From afb2322a39c207abf23946082472805ca74b52af Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pascal Paillet <p.paillet@st.com>
Date: Tue, 19 Mar 2024 15:51:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 623/913] plat-stm32mp1: stm32mp1_stpmic1: handle st,mask-reset

Fix test "if (priv->flags & PMIC_REGU_FLAG_MASK_RESET)" that was
always true.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 7a1567ce753a2f1628ddfd4a1682f6ed5f8c9e19 plat-stm32mp1: stm32mp1_stpmic1: handle st,mask-reset]
Change-Id: Ib2a47eeac4dd8c4a2387d677e1911f7c9c02dc98
Signed-off-by: Pascal Paillet <p.paillet@st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/367951
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Gatien CHEVALLIER <gatien.chevallier@st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
Domain-Review: Patrick DELAUNAY <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
---
 core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp1/drivers/stm32mp1_stpmic1.c | 7 ++-----
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp1/drivers/stm32mp1_stpmic1.c b/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp1/drivers/stm32mp1_stpmic1.c
index ed6b2b1bb..6fa583f34 100644
--- a/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp1/drivers/stm32mp1_stpmic1.c
+++ b/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp1/drivers/stm32mp1_stpmic1.c
@@ -39,13 +39,10 @@
 
 #define PMIC_REGU_COUNT			14
 
-enum {
-	PMIC_REGU_FLAG_MASK_RESET = 0,
-	PMIC_REGU_FLAG_COUNT
-};
+/* PMIC private flags */
+#define PMIC_REGU_FLAG_MASK_RESET	BIT(0)
 
 static_assert(IS_ENABLED(CFG_DRIVERS_REGULATOR));
-static_assert(PMIC_REGU_FLAG_COUNT <= UINT_MAX);
 
 /*
  * struct pmic_regulator_data - Platform specific data
